{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16<strong>Control Four Unique Robots</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>four playable robots</strong> in the game, each with completely different abilities and combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will control them one by one as they explore rooms inside the android\u2019s body, defeat enemies, and fight their way toward the end of each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/4282e388797a42b3531a4f83a57276d6.poster.avif?t=1774519547\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/4282e388797a42b3531a4f83a57276d6.webm?t=1774519547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/4282e388797a42b3531a4f83a57276d6.mp4?t=1774519547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2<strong>Randomized Combat Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a <strong>roguelike-style stage structure</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you enter a stage, <strong>room connections and enemy combinations change randomly</strong>, making every run unpredictable and challenging.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/3127c8ed34399141d468b423dcfb6c6e.poster.avif?t=1774519547\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/3127c8ed34399141d468b423dcfb6c6e.webm?t=1774519547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/3127c8ed34399141d468b423dcfb6c6e.mp4?t=1774519547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7e<strong>Four-Robot Relay Boss Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each stage, you will encounter a <strong>powerful boss</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will fight the boss <strong>using all four robots one after another</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When one robot falls, the next one immediately takes its place.<br>Defeat the boss before your entire team is destroyed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/60c5da69a40d516fd97ad3d07a5d4f2f.avif?t=1774519547\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode and Game Leaderboard</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within a collective of androids, an unusual individual has appeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An android known as <strong>Unit X</strong> has developed <strong>self-awareness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To humans, this is extremely dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To correct this anomaly, humans sealed four <strong>\u201cCorrection Robots\u201d</strong> inside a capsule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When X opens its mouth to sing, the capsule is thrown into its body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The robots are released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They have only one mission:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the body.</strong><br><br><strong>Correct its thoughts.</strong><br><br><strong>Return it to the collective.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.