e_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/4282e388797a42b3531a4f83a57276d6.mp4?t=1774519547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2<strong>Randomized Combat Encounters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a <strong>roguelike-style stage structure</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you enter a stage, <strong>room connections and enemy combinations change randomly</strong>, making every run unpredictable and challenging.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/3127c8ed34399141d468b423dcfb6c6e.poster.avif?t=1774519547\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/3127c8ed34399141d468b423dcfb6c6e.webm?t=1774519547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/3127c8ed34399141d468b423dcfb6c6e.mp4?t=1774519547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7e<strong>Four-Robot Relay Boss Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each stage, you will encounter a <strong>powerful boss</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will fight the boss <strong>using all four robots one after another</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When one robot falls, the next one immediately takes its place.<br>Defeat the boss before your entire team is destroyed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/extras/60c5da69a40d516fd97ad3d07a5d4f2f.avif?t=1774519547\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode and Game Leaderboard</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within a collective of androids, an unusual individual has appeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An android known as <strong>Unit X</strong> has developed <strong>self-awareness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To humans, this is extremely dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To correct this anomaly, humans sealed four <strong>\u201cCorrection Robots\u201d</strong> inside a capsule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When X opens its mouth to sing, the capsule is thrown into its body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The robots are released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They have only one mission:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the body.</strong><br><br><strong>Correct its thoughts.</strong><br><br><strong>Return it to the collective.</strong></p>","developers":["SpringBone"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3774410/34448ad1154e2757724e12186db4bf6d44636045/header.jpg?t=1774519547","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3774410/437448485/11275a92dc382beb7b7ef10c373b90f588c749d7/1774503952/dash_av1.mpd?t=1774504806","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3774410/437448485/11275a92dc382beb7b7ef10c373b90f588c749d7/1774503952/dash_h264.mpd?t=1774504806","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3774410/437448485/11275a92dc382beb7